Hi, I just found this looking for how to resolve my own issue trying to run GGIR on some old awd files. It turns out my files have for some reason a "%d-%b-%Y" so months are expressed as "Jan" for January, for example. I changed it by hand for some files and the program run correctly (or at least it completes the job). Not sure how many people will have this issue and so if it would be worthy to work on it, but seeing you were able to fix this before, it might not be really hard, so I'm letting you know.

