Hi Jinfeng,

The error occurs because part 5 does not find valid days by which the part5 cleaned report is not generated. Next, part5 struggles to create data dictionary because it currently uses the cleaned report to derive the available variable names.

You would not have this problem if you processed multiple files of which at least one has valid data.

I will have a look whether I can make the code better handle this situation.

Vincent

